# Scattered into Shadow (jeuno 61), GM-set states. Accepted at Prog 3 with no sprig, logged in in Castle Oztroja: the
# zone-in at Prog 3 adds no listener; a GM's Prog 4 at once (before any tick): with no listener Tebhi stays
# CUTSCENE_ONLY through the ticks. Brutus at Prog 2 with no sprig: no arm of his answers (nil: Path of the
# Beastmaster's 20, then his script's 134). Osker at Prog 2: nil (Path of the Beastmaster's 45). The middle pool at
# Prog 2 with Aquaflora 3 given back: 18 (Prog 2 is tested first). At Prog 1 with Aquaflora 3: Dabotz's Ghost popped;
# Aquaflora 3 taken by a GM before the kill: its death leaves Prog 1; the pool then: nil.
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Osker/onTrigger Feiyin/Underground_Pool/onTrigger Feiyin/Dabotzs_Ghost/onMobDeath
char zone=CastleOztroja pos=-134.5,24,-21 job=BST lvl=50
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster completed
quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold completed
quest Jeuno.ScatteredIntoShadow accepted
charvar Quest[3][61]Prog 3
charvar Quest[3][61]Stage 7
login                                       # the zone-in at Prog 3: no listener
charvar Quest[3][61]Prog 4                  # a GM's Prog 4, no zone-in
tick 1000                                   # no listener: Tebhi stays CUTSCENE_ONLY
tick 1000
charvar Quest[3][61]Prog 2
warp -55.5,8.2,97.5 UpperJeuno
trigger Brutus                              # Prog 2, no sprig: no arm (nil): Path of the Beastmaster's 20
finish-if-event
trigger Brutus                              # the next turn
finish-if-event
trigger Osker                               # Prog 2: nil; Path of the Beastmaster's 45
finish-if-event
warp 11.5,0,250 Feiyin
keyitem Aquaflora3
trigger Underground_Pool+1                  # Prog 2: 18 (before the sprig)
finish                                      # Aquaflora 3 deleted, Prog 3, Stage bit 2
keyitem Aquaflora3
charvar Quest[3][61]Prog 1
trigger Underground_Pool+1                  # Prog 1, Aquaflora 3: the ghost popped; noAction
delkeyitem Aquaflora3
kill DABOTZS_GHOST                          # its death without Aquaflora 3: Prog stays 1
trigger Underground_Pool+1                  # Prog 1, no Aquaflora 3: nil
